  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the total maximum value of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi></msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
  "options": [
